WEBVTT

00:00:01.050 --> 00:00:08.220
Stepping out on
an ordinary Sunday

00:00:08.220 --> 00:00:14.730
Stepping out!
A miracle's gonna happen

00:00:14.730 --> 00:00:16.560
It's my day!

00:00:22.670 --> 00:00:27.140
Maybe I'll throw off my pajamas

00:00:29.610 --> 00:00:34.550
and head out to see her right now

00:00:36.510 --> 00:00:41.920
I always turned my eyes away,
thinking she'd hate me

00:00:43.590 --> 00:00:49.330
Now I'm saying goodbye
to that negative attitude

00:00:50.530 --> 00:00:55.100
My favorite shoes
will always take me

00:00:57.600 --> 00:01:02.240
To a place where I'll be happy

00:01:04.410 --> 00:01:09.750
It's not someone else
I want to embrace

00:01:11.450 --> 00:01:15.890
But a version of
myself that's not fake

00:01:15.890 --> 00:01:18.950
I just want to walk

00:01:19.290 --> 00:01:22.490
Not on tip-toe

00:01:22.730 --> 00:01:26.460
Not downcast, either

00:01:27.430 --> 00:01:35.370
Just I'm stepping out
on an ordinary Sunday

00:01:35.370 --> 00:01:41.810
Stepping out!
Making a little try, try, try

00:01:41.810 --> 00:01:44.080
It's my day!

00:01:53.020 --> 00:01:56.390
I hope Domyoji doesn't come
to school today.

00:02:19.480 --> 00:02:20.510
<i>Makino...</i>

00:02:20.510 --> 00:02:21.650
<i>Huh?</i>

00:02:22.250 --> 00:02:24.460
<i>Oh, nothing.</i>

00:02:25.520 --> 00:02:30.560
<i>I don't understand him at all.
What's he thinking?</i>

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:38.900
"Love Moves Too Fast"

00:02:42.640 --> 00:02:43.610
<i>What's this?</i>

00:02:46.140 --> 00:02:48.270
Good morning, Makino!

00:02:52.880 --> 00:02:55.250
<i>Ugh! Asai's gang!</i>

00:02:56.850 --> 00:02:58.520
Good morning.

00:02:59.520 --> 00:03:02.370
But calling you "Makino" 
is much too formal.

00:03:02.370 --> 00:03:04.220
We're classmates, after all.

00:03:04.590 --> 00:03:08.430
I know! Your name is Tsukushi, so can we call you Tsuki?

00:03:08.660 --> 00:03:10.430
That's cute!

00:03:10.930 --> 00:03:14.330
Tsuki is perfect! Right, Tsuki?

00:03:15.700 --> 00:03:18.500
<i>What's with these girls
all of a sudden?</i>

00:03:25.310 --> 00:03:26.950
Tsuki...

00:03:30.850 --> 00:03:32.720
<i>What's going on?</i>

00:03:40.020 --> 00:03:41.460
Hurry! Hurry!

00:03:51.470 --> 00:03:52.880
Right this way.

00:03:58.180 --> 00:04:00.320
Congratulations, Miss Makino!

00:04:01.650 --> 00:04:04.680
<i>What's this all about?</i>

00:04:12.260 --> 00:04:15.870
Tsukushi... isn't everyone
acting weird today?

00:04:16.360 --> 00:04:17.530
Yeah...

00:04:18.190 --> 00:04:20.160
<i>What's up with everyone?</i>

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.100
Tsukushi!

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:30.550
Hm?

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:34.050
Scoop! Getting Close and Cuddly
in Aoyama in the Early Morning!

00:04:31.940 --> 00:04:34.050
What is this?

00:04:34.610 --> 00:04:35.850
What?!

00:04:43.990 --> 00:04:45.820
<i>Nail polish by Den Ore...</i>

00:04:48.990 --> 00:04:52.860
See? I knew this color would
look great on you.

00:04:54.900 --> 00:04:57.270
You've got such pretty nails.

00:04:57.630 --> 00:04:59.600
You really should take care of them.

00:05:01.270 --> 00:05:04.140
I know! Why don't you take the bottle?

00:05:04.940 --> 00:05:05.890
But...

00:05:05.890 --> 00:05:09.610
Don't worry about it.
I've got plenty of it.

00:05:11.080 --> 00:05:14.050
I appreciate it,
but I couldn't accept.

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:16.390
Don't be silly, Tsuki!

00:05:16.390 --> 00:05:19.590
Why are you acting like a stranger?

00:05:19.890 --> 00:05:22.720
We're friends, aren't we?

00:05:25.490 --> 00:05:31.370
So tell your friends
how you won Domyoji heart, hm?

00:05:32.600 --> 00:05:35.040
I didn't. This is just
a misunderstanding.

00:05:35.440 --> 00:05:38.170
Come on... no need to be shy.

00:05:39.210 --> 00:05:40.640
Yeah.

00:05:41.610 --> 00:05:45.710
We need that information
to bag the other F4s.

00:05:47.880 --> 00:05:50.340
<i>They treated me like dirt before.</i>

00:05:50.340 --> 00:05:54.020
<i>But now that they think
I'm Domyoji's girlfriend...</i>

00:05:54.750 --> 00:05:57.120
<i>...they're acting all buddy-buddy.</i>

00:05:58.490 --> 00:06:01.960
<i>The F4 sure carry a lot of clout.</i>

00:06:07.970 --> 00:06:09.150
Tsukasa!

00:06:09.970 --> 00:06:10.880
Yo...

00:06:11.570 --> 00:06:13.010
Over your cold?

00:06:14.870 --> 00:06:17.580
To think that even you
can catch a cold.

00:06:21.510 --> 00:06:24.620
I saw the bulletin board, Tsukasa.

00:06:24.950 --> 00:06:26.450
Huh? What do you mean?

00:06:27.720 --> 00:06:31.060
Your date... it was with Makino, huh?

00:06:31.960 --> 00:06:33.490
You were out 'til sunrise?

00:06:39.460 --> 00:06:41.470
Yeah, well... yeah.

00:06:42.200 --> 00:06:43.770
So how was it?

00:06:44.240 --> 00:06:46.270
How was what?

00:06:46.970 --> 00:06:49.940
Don't play dumb. You know. <i>It</i>.

00:06:50.370 --> 00:06:52.690
Yeah. Hot enough to give you a fever?

00:06:53.580 --> 00:06:54.910
<i>What do they mean by "it"?</i>

00:06:56.380 --> 00:06:58.780
It was awful. She strangled me.

00:06:59.580 --> 00:07:01.450
She strangled you?!

00:07:02.190 --> 00:07:04.790
Yeah. All night long.

00:07:05.510 --> 00:07:06.920
All night?

00:07:07.360 --> 00:07:09.610
She's hardcore. Totally.

00:07:09.610 --> 00:07:11.710
Where'd you do it?

00:07:12.730 --> 00:07:14.460
In the elevator.

00:07:14.460 --> 00:07:16.730
The <i>elevator</i>?!

00:07:17.400 --> 00:07:20.720
Dude! That's <i>so</i> hot!

00:07:20.720 --> 00:07:22.720
Even <i>I</i> haven't done that yet.

00:07:23.240 --> 00:07:26.480
I guess it was kind of exciting.

00:07:26.720 --> 00:07:29.980
Tsukasa... I'm so sorry for
ragging on you so much.

00:07:30.650 --> 00:07:33.730
You're the greatest.
That's why you're the leader of the F4.

00:07:40.890 --> 00:07:42.660
Here comes your sweetheart.

00:07:43.760 --> 00:07:45.410
<i>Ack! Tsukasa...</i>

00:07:49.600 --> 00:07:52.640
Don't just stand there.
Say something, Tsuki.

00:07:57.170 --> 00:07:59.780
Don't be shy, Tsukasa... talk to her.

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:03.310
H-how are you?

00:08:05.150 --> 00:08:08.170
You're not a kid!
Why're you so nervous?

00:08:08.170 --> 00:08:10.120
You spent the night together, right?

00:08:11.150 --> 00:08:12.810
Shut up! I'm outta here.

00:08:12.810 --> 00:08:14.160
Hey, Tsukasa...

00:08:17.560 --> 00:08:21.000
<i>Why don't you tell them
I'm not your girlfriend?</i>

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:24.150
I'm impressed, Tsuki.

00:08:24.150 --> 00:08:26.330
Domyoji actually talked to you!

00:08:26.670 --> 00:08:30.360
Your best friends are proud of you!

00:08:31.870 --> 00:08:32.920
<i>Best friends?</i>

00:08:32.920 --> 00:08:35.610
We'll be best friends forever!

00:08:36.580 --> 00:08:39.160
Listen, this isn't what you think...

00:08:42.480 --> 00:08:44.920
<i>I haven't walked arm-in-arm
with girls in years.</i>

00:08:45.650 --> 00:08:47.390
<i>Not since middle school.</i>

00:08:48.590 --> 00:08:50.890
<i>I know they're not
really my friends,</i>

00:08:53.390 --> 00:08:57.830
<i>but I'm glad Domyoji didn't out us.</i>

00:09:29.360 --> 00:09:32.000
Um... Miss Makino...

00:09:37.600 --> 00:09:40.410
Do you remember me?

00:09:44.980 --> 00:09:46.750
Who are you?

00:09:49.380 --> 00:09:53.650
You don't remember?
I'm Sakurako Sanjo.

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:00.160
Oh! I remember you now!

00:10:01.930 --> 00:10:03.490
You're a student here?

00:10:04.560 --> 00:10:07.400
Yeah. I'm glad to see you again.

00:10:09.000 --> 00:10:11.570
Thank you for your help.

00:10:12.100 --> 00:10:13.440
It's nothing...

00:10:14.570 --> 00:10:18.530
I saw the bulletin board.
Congratulations.

00:10:21.450 --> 00:10:23.450
Uh... thanks!

00:10:25.520 --> 00:10:28.110
<i>Now I'm lying.
What am I gonna do?</i>

00:10:28.620 --> 00:10:30.110
Tsuki!

00:10:33.360 --> 00:10:35.760
How could you leave without us?

00:10:40.360 --> 00:10:42.770
Who's this girl, Tsuki?

00:10:45.500 --> 00:10:47.430
Oh, I know!

00:10:47.430 --> 00:10:50.630
The boys are all talking about
a really cute freshman.

00:10:50.970 --> 00:10:53.510
Oh, no... it's not me.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:00.410
But you're not as cute as Tsuki, are you?

00:11:00.980 --> 00:11:04.590
After all, she's the one
who captured Domyoji's heart.

00:11:05.960 --> 00:11:09.660
C'mon, Tsuki. Let's go clubbing.

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:11.290
Clubbing?

00:11:12.060 --> 00:11:15.230
There's a really hot spot
called G Nights.

00:11:16.100 --> 00:11:17.580
B-but I...

00:11:17.580 --> 00:11:21.170
C'mon! It won't be fun
without you.

00:11:22.370 --> 00:11:23.570
<i>Yeah, right.</i>

00:11:24.970 --> 00:11:28.310
<i>I haven't forgotten how rotten
they treated me.</i>

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:32.050
Come on, Tsuki. Let's go.

00:11:34.720 --> 00:11:36.640
Why don't you come with us, Sakurako?

00:11:37.050 --> 00:11:39.940
No, thank you.
I'm not much for clubbing.

00:11:39.940 --> 00:11:43.480
Right. Not a quiet girl like her.

00:11:43.480 --> 00:11:44.490
Let's go.

00:11:45.190 --> 00:11:46.160
But...

00:11:52.470 --> 00:11:53.590
<i>Oh, well...</i>

00:11:53.590 --> 00:11:56.470
<i>I've got no choice but to pretend
I'm Domyoji's girlfriend.</i>

00:11:58.340 --> 00:11:59.210
<i>But...</i>

00:12:23.590 --> 00:12:27.190
There aren't any good-looking guys.

00:12:29.600 --> 00:12:31.100
Guess it's an off night.

00:12:32.040 --> 00:12:34.040
<i>They're more interested in boys
than dancing.</i>

00:12:37.740 --> 00:12:40.180
Check out that handsome foreigner.

00:12:46.620 --> 00:12:49.620
Oh yeah! He's a hottie!
Think he's a model?

00:12:51.080 --> 00:12:53.580
This is why I like G Nights.

00:12:58.630 --> 00:13:02.170
<i>That guy reminds me of Rui Hanazawa.</i>

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:05.140
Ooh! He's coming this way!

00:13:07.810 --> 00:13:08.230
Hi.

00:13:08.910 --> 00:13:10.140
Hi!

00:13:10.910 --> 00:13:12.310
Wanna dance?

00:13:12.780 --> 00:13:14.170
He spoke Japanese...

00:13:14.170 --> 00:13:15.150
Come on...

00:13:16.280 --> 00:13:20.410
Me? Oh no! I can't dance.
<i>No dance, dance.</i>

00:13:20.810 --> 00:13:24.190
Way to go, Tsuki.
You scored! Go for it.

00:13:24.920 --> 00:13:26.420
Wait! Don't pull me!

00:13:28.490 --> 00:13:31.000
Geez! Why is it always Tsuki?!

00:13:41.270 --> 00:13:42.100
<i>He's good.</i>

00:13:52.850 --> 00:13:54.420
<i>Eyes like blue marbles...</i>

00:13:54.950 --> 00:13:57.390
<i>And when he lifts his chin
and narrows his eyes...</i>

00:13:57.790 --> 00:13:59.760
<i>He really does look like him.</i>

00:14:00.960 --> 00:14:02.990
You're cute. What's your name?

00:14:03.660 --> 00:14:05.660
Tsukushi Makino.

00:14:08.660 --> 00:14:09.770
Tsukushi?

00:14:14.970 --> 00:14:17.240
Why don't we go someplace?

00:14:46.470 --> 00:14:48.970
What a wonderful dream...

00:14:49.570 --> 00:14:53.100
I met a handsome foreigner
who looked like Rui Hanazawa.

00:14:54.810 --> 00:14:57.440
Huh? There's a chandelier...

00:14:58.250 --> 00:15:00.650
We don't have those
in our house.

00:15:00.650 --> 00:15:03.620
Right, Mom? Susumu?

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:12.660
<i>Where am I? Who am I?</i>

00:15:18.900 --> 00:15:20.230
I'm not wearing any clothes!

00:15:23.840 --> 00:15:26.870
<i>Calm down, Tsukushi.
Think carefully.</i>

00:15:28.240 --> 00:15:32.080
<i>Tsukushi, a toast... to our meeting.</i>

00:15:34.250 --> 00:15:36.750
<i>After dancing, we toasted
 with juice.</i>

00:15:37.350 --> 00:15:39.290
<i>After that, it's all blank.</i>

00:15:40.620 --> 00:15:43.290
<i>Don't tell me... I slept with him?</i>

00:15:43.720 --> 00:15:46.030
<i>Oh no! What'll I do?</i>

00:15:49.430 --> 00:15:51.030
<i>How could I be so stupid?</i>

00:15:51.760 --> 00:15:54.010
<i>Lying because I liked
the attention.</i>

00:15:54.010 --> 00:15:55.600
<i>This is what I get for it.</i>

00:15:57.640 --> 00:16:00.040
<i>What's Domyoji doing here?</i>

00:16:00.610 --> 00:16:01.570
You're late!

00:16:02.240 --> 00:16:03.640
Where have you been?

00:16:04.140 --> 00:16:06.450
You shouldn't be coming
to school at noon.

00:16:07.750 --> 00:16:10.620
You weren't waiting for me,
were you?

00:16:11.420 --> 00:16:14.120
Don't be stupid! Why should I?

00:16:15.390 --> 00:16:17.790
I was heading to the cafeteria.

00:16:18.420 --> 00:16:19.990
But the cafeteria's the other way.

00:16:20.490 --> 00:16:23.840
So what? I like taking
the long way around.

00:16:23.840 --> 00:16:24.860
Quit pick-nitting.

00:16:28.200 --> 00:16:30.200
That's nit-picking, you moron!

00:16:32.370 --> 00:16:35.910
Hang on! I can't eat that much!

00:16:35.910 --> 00:16:38.340
You don't get to eat
quality food much, do you?

00:16:38.780 --> 00:16:39.910
Stock up.

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:42.250
I'll pay...

00:16:43.010 --> 00:16:45.220
Are you trying to embarrass me?

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:48.620
I'd never let a woman
pay for her meal.

00:16:53.420 --> 00:16:56.130
Wow... she's eating with the F4.

00:16:56.860 --> 00:16:59.630
Lucky! I'm so jealous!

00:17:01.670 --> 00:17:03.200
<i>Everybody envies me.</i>

00:17:04.000 --> 00:17:06.840
<i>Domyoji's rough, but sweet.</i>

00:17:08.170 --> 00:17:10.240
<i>I don't know what he's thinking...</i>

00:17:12.740 --> 00:17:16.550
<i>But I'll just enjoy
the moment for what it is.</i>

00:17:22.350 --> 00:17:25.190
Pipe down, will you?!

00:17:26.690 --> 00:17:29.390
<i>But... if word gets out
about this morning...!</i>

00:17:29.390 --> 00:17:31.730
<i>I'll be back to
class scapegoat again!</i>

00:17:32.290 --> 00:17:33.630
<i>I don't want that!</i>

00:17:35.530 --> 00:17:37.170
<i>No one will ever find out.</i>

00:17:37.500 --> 00:17:39.970
<i>I'll never see that foreigner again.</i>

00:17:41.500 --> 00:17:44.010
<i>This secret will
stay dead and buried.</i>

00:17:44.740 --> 00:17:45.740
Absolutely!

00:17:47.710 --> 00:17:48.810
Sakurako!

00:17:50.580 --> 00:17:53.620
Wow, what a great house!

00:17:53.620 --> 00:17:56.520
It's so old. It's embarrassing.

00:17:57.320 --> 00:18:00.630
But anyway, thanks for coming
on such short notice.

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:04.560
You're really rich, huh, Sakurako?

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:07.960
Your yard is huge!

00:18:09.430 --> 00:18:11.530
I live here with my grandparents.

00:18:12.130 --> 00:18:14.500
Where are your folks? Abroad?

00:18:16.270 --> 00:18:19.610
They died in a plane crash
five years ago.

00:18:21.310 --> 00:18:23.410
I'm sorry. I didn't know.

00:18:24.180 --> 00:18:25.580
No, it's fine.

00:18:25.880 --> 00:18:31.150
It's embarrassing,
but we live on my inheritance.

00:18:37.190 --> 00:18:38.390
<i>Is that why...?</i>

00:18:39.190 --> 00:18:42.600
<i>She's kind of humble...
not like the other students.</i>

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:44.970
<i>She's like a lovely flower.</i>

00:18:46.000 --> 00:18:48.440
<i>Truly an elegant lady.</i>

00:18:52.710 --> 00:18:56.180
Were you at Eitoku until first grade?

00:18:56.680 --> 00:19:00.210
Yes. After that, we moved to Germany
for my dad's job.

00:19:01.380 --> 00:19:04.220
I transferred back to Eitoku
as a freshman...

00:19:05.020 --> 00:19:07.350
I was shocked by the F4's power.

00:19:08.520 --> 00:19:11.720
I heard about you
when you received the red slip.

00:19:12.060 --> 00:19:13.790
Oh, that!

00:19:18.130 --> 00:19:20.730
I was really impressed.

00:19:21.170 --> 00:19:23.220
When I saw how you kept coming
to school...

00:19:23.220 --> 00:19:25.440
even when everyone hated you...

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:27.270
I found you so strong.

00:19:28.140 --> 00:19:29.810
You're my hero.

00:19:30.510 --> 00:19:34.450
Oh, now... you're embarrassing me.

00:19:37.420 --> 00:19:41.060
I understand, because
I was bullied, too.

00:19:41.890 --> 00:19:44.220
You were picked on, Sakurako?

00:19:45.460 --> 00:19:46.220
Yes...

00:19:47.090 --> 00:19:50.030
I'll bet they were jealous
because you're so cute.

00:19:50.830 --> 00:19:55.050
That's why I can't believe
those people cozying up to you...

00:19:55.050 --> 00:19:56.900
just because you're Domyoji's girlfriend.

00:19:58.270 --> 00:20:01.610
I'm sorry.
I shouldn't have said that.

00:20:01.610 --> 00:20:04.380
That's okay. It's only the truth.

00:20:06.780 --> 00:20:08.580
<i>I'm not even his girlfriend.</i>

00:20:09.180 --> 00:20:12.280
<i>I'm just as bad,
taking advantage of the lie.</i>

00:20:13.620 --> 00:20:15.450
<i>I think I hate myself.</i>

00:20:18.560 --> 00:20:22.090
It's great that you have
such a lovely room.

00:20:23.990 --> 00:20:25.630
So many books!

00:20:27.360 --> 00:20:30.540
Is this a photo album? Can I see?

00:20:30.540 --> 00:20:32.280
No... Don't!

00:20:52.190 --> 00:20:57.160
I'm sorry for shouting.
Forgive me.

00:20:57.730 --> 00:21:01.270
No... I'm sorry.

00:21:05.200 --> 00:21:06.330
I'm home!

00:21:09.240 --> 00:21:11.240
Our tenant's back.

00:21:11.640 --> 00:21:12.670
Tenant?

00:21:15.210 --> 00:21:18.500
Let me introduce you to
my old friend from Germany...

00:21:18.500 --> 00:21:19.910
Thomas.

00:21:45.440 --> 00:21:46.250
<i>No way!</i>

00:22:05.530 --> 00:22:11.600
You let your hair down a little

00:22:13.570 --> 00:22:19.470
You hid the fact
that you were crying

00:22:21.240 --> 00:22:29.350
I noticed, but I
couldn't ask you why

00:22:29.580 --> 00:22:37.390
I can never be
honest about how I feel

00:22:37.390 --> 00:22:45.160
Until after we've split
up after a bad fight

00:22:45.430 --> 00:22:53.300
I can say it now,
though, over and over

00:22:45.430 --> 00:22:53.300
(Sorry girl, I was
wrong and I love you)

00:22:53.300 --> 00:23:01.680
I can say "I love you"...

00:22:53.300 --> 00:23:01.680
